Peterson's a psychology professor at the

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.540
University of Toronto.

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:13.880
When Canada proposed a law declaring it illegal

00:00:13.889 --> 00:00:17.060
not to call someone by their preferred pronoun,

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:18.570
in other words illegal not to

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:21.500
address those who don't want to be called he or she

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.380
as say,

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:23.660
