00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:32.600
It's not just students who object.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.880
Hundreds of his colleagues signed a petition

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.540
demanding that Peterson be fired.

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:40.080
They say his behavior is a danger.

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:45.860
Now, when he tries to speak,

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:49.300
protestors often surround him blowing air horns or

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:50.420
