00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:52.760
to make sure others cannot hear him.

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:55.640
At this school, he and students who wanted to

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:58.260
hear him moved outside to escape the noise

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:00.180
but the protesters just followed him

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:02.040
and drowned him out again.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:09.160
If somebody wants to be called Ze or Zir, why not?

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:10.700
I don't care what people want to be called,

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:11.780
