00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:12.960
I should be compelled by law

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:14.500
to call them that.

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.900
The government has absolutely no business whatsoever

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:20.720
ever governing the content of your voluntary speech.

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:23.400
But if I personally said, I'd like you to

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:26.180
call me Ze or Zen?

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:27.920
We could have a conversation about that.

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:30.100
Just like I would if you asked me to use a nickname

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:32.400
for example so but there's a big

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:33.657
difference between

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:36.280
privately negotiated modes of address

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:37.820
and legislatively

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:39.580
demanded compelled speech.

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:46.120
Protesters call Peterson all sorts of names.

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:49.600
They've called me lots of things.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:50.520
Hitler that was one.

00:01:52.660 --> 00:01:54.220
The fact that it has to do with transgender people

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:56.060
is virtually irrelevant,

00:01:56.060 --> 00:01:57.440
the issue is compelled speech.

